  unitName: Beast Zegar
  unitId: 10021
  unitNumber: 25
  description: A boy found in a huge jungle in the territory of the devastated Agni
    Empire. Completely feral, he could not even understand human language. However,
    his physical abilities were so strong that when attacked by a knight the boy
    held him off without injury. Mystery surrounds Zegar, as even growing up in the
    jungle cannot explain his claws.
